WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.190
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:06.050
When I first arrived at MIT
as a freshman two years ago,

00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:08.850
my FPOP counselor suggested
I joined this club called,

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:11.160
Dance Troupe.

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:12.810
I'd never danced
before, but I figured

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:15.252
I would give it a
try for one semester.

00:00:15.252 --> 00:00:17.460
I mean, after all, that's
what P and R is for, right?

00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:24.970
Today, I'm a member of
Ridonkulous and Asian Dance

00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:25.480
Team.

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:28.150
And I'm an officer and
choreographer for Dance Troupe.

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:30.490
It's a lot, for sure,
but it's so, so worth it.

00:00:34.546 --> 00:00:36.920
Dance has helped me become
more confident and comfortable

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:39.120
in my own body, and the
people are just the best.

00:00:41.862 --> 00:00:44.281
We tease each other and
joke with each other,

00:00:44.281 --> 00:00:46.905
but at the end of the day, these
guys have my back in anything.

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:56.920
I've been a part of this family
for the first half of my MIT

00:00:56.920 --> 00:01:01.110
career, and I'm so, so excited
to see what happens next.

